Answers the tile requests waiting on a glyph range that fails to load or
parse, with that range's glyphs missing, and requests the range again for the
next tile that needs it. Without this, a static or tile map whose still image
failed on a glyph range never finishes its next still image
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/786).
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4837 at 5d3ca0b0

